@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Запис зриву та повідомлення активному ментору
actor User
participant "Expo Web" as Front
participant "FastAPI" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
actor Mentor
User -> Front : Save relapse
Front -> API : POST /api/v1/calendar/entries (JWT)
API -> API : Validate session, owner, date, input
API -> DB : BEGIN; lock user, relationship, record
API -> DB : INSERT record; recompute progress
API -> DB : Mark first relapse once
opt first relapse and active mentor
 API -> DB : INSERT notification (unique recipient/event_key)
end
alt success
 API -> DB : COMMIT
 API --> Front : 201 Created
 Front -> Front : Refresh calendar / home / statistics / goals
else any failure
 API -> DB : ROLLBACK
 API --> Front : Structured error
end
Mentor -> Front : Open inbox
Front -> API : GET /api/v1/notifications (mentor JWT)
API -> DB : SELECT own notifications
API --> Front : Items and current permissions
note over API,DB
PATCH uses the same transaction; editing only within 48 hours inclusive.
No duplicate event after sober/relapse toggles or later mentorship join.
end note
@enduml
